- [LabVIEW Compiler optimizations – LabVIEW Wiki](https://labviewwiki.org/wiki/LabVIEW_Compiler_optimizations)
- [Inline subvi – NI Community](https://forums.ni.com/t5/LabVIEW/Inline-subvi/td-p/1279078)
- [How to change tunnel mode using VI scripting – NI Community](https://forums.ni.com/t5/LabVIEW/How-to-change-tunnel-mode-using-vi-scripting/td-p/3969392)
